7824.d:
This piece is inspired by Jaume Plensa's Large Nomad sculture [https://jaumeplensa.com/works-and-projects/public-space/nomade-2010].  He said "Like bricks, letters have a potential for construction. They enable us to construct thought". Projecting this idea in the crypto world, I used the "fxhash" as the central element of this piece. Sub-sequences of it are used as a brush, rotating around orbits to form "storms". 
All the parameters are randomized, and allow to obtain very varied forms (see the variations). 33 different palettes, [1,4] storms.

- Press (x) to save a screenshot;
- Press (p) to pause / unpause;

Built with p5js by @Aqw_Zert[https://twitter.com/Aqw_Zert]

